Version: 1.0.2
Section: sound
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: handsomeme1688-web <hamburgeryummy614@gmail.com>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi (>= 3.36), gir1.2-gtk-3.0 (>= 3.24), gir1.2-webkit2-4.1 (>= 2.36) | gir1.2-webkit2-4.0 (>= 2.28), ca-certificates, librsvg2-common, gstreamer1.0-plugins-base, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good, gstreamer1.0-libav, gstreamer1.0-alsa, gstreamer1.0-plugins-good (>= 1.18) | gstreamer1.0-pulseaudio
Recommends: fonts-noto-cjk | fonts-wqy-microhei, dbus-user-session | dbus-x11
Homepage: https://music.163.com/st/webplayer
Description: Standalone WebKitGTK desktop wrapper for NetEase Cloud Music
 A small unofficial Debian/Ubuntu desktop application that opens the NetEase
 Cloud Music web player in an isolated WebKitGTK window. It does not use
 Google Chrome, Chromium, or Electron. An Internet connection is required.
